                     " href="/">Go to Home</a><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--$--><footer class="darkFooter_uberFooter__gPAN9"><div class="container"><div class="darkFooter_footer_about__LHOqL flex flex-wrap lg:flex-nowrap"><a title="Testgrid" class="darkFooter_footer_logo__Zk0S_" href="/"><img alt="Testgrid" loading="lazy" width="344" height="64" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftglogo.a5d5a921.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftglogo.a5d5a921.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftglogo.a5d5a921.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75"/></a><div class="darkFooter_footer_about_content___OwMa"><p>TestGrid is a leading provider of end-to-end automation cloud and on-premise testing solutions. With a focus on simplifying the testing process, TestGrid&#x27;s innovative AI-powered technology allows organizations to achieve significant time and cost savings while accelerating their go-to-market strategies.</p></div></div><div class="darkFooter_row__4OYCe grid grid-cols-12 md:gap-x-[30px]"><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 lg:col-span-3"><div class="darkFooter_footer_menu__nmx_1"><p>Industries</p><ul><li><a title="Retail, eCommerce" href="/solutions/retail-ecommerce">Retail, eCommerce</a></li><li><a title="Telco" href="/solutions/telco">Telco</a></li><li><a title="Media and Entertainment" href="/solutions/media-entertainment">Media &amp; Entertainment</a></li><li><a title="Insurance &amp; InsureTech" href="/solutions/insurance">Insurance &amp; InsureTech</a></li><li><a title="Banking Financial &amp; FinTech" href="/solutions/bfsi-testing">Banking Financial &amp; FinTech</a></li><li><a title="Healthcare &amp; Health Insurance" href="/solutions/healthcare">Healthcare &amp; Health Insurance</a></li><li><a title="Travel, Leisure and Hospitality" href="/solutions/travel">Travel, Leisure and Hospitality</a></li><li>Manufacturing <small>(Coming Soon)</small></li><li><a title="Pharma" href="/solutions/pharma">Pharma</a></li></ul></div><div class="darkFooter_footer_menu__nmx_1"><p>Enterprise Testing</p><ul><li><a title="TestGrid Device Lab" href="/device-lab">TestGrid Device Lab</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 lg:col-span-3"><div class="darkFooter_footer_menu__nmx_1"><p>What&#x27;s New<!-- --> 🔥</p><ul><li><a title="Build Your Own Lab" class="font-semibold" href="/byol-on-prem-testing-lab">Build Your Own Lab</a></li><li><a title="Ebook - Death of Automation QA" class="font-semibold" href="/ai-powered-testing-gold-standard">Ebook - Death of Automation QA</a></li><li><a title="CoTester" href="/cotester">CoTester</a></li><li><a title="Test on iPhone 17" href="/test-on-iphone-17">Test on iPhone 17</a></li><li><a title="Virtual USB" href="/virtual-usb">Virtual USB</a></li><li><a title="Visual Testing" href="/visual-testing">Visual Testing</a></li></ul></div><div class="darkFooter_footer_menu__nmx_1"><p>Compare To</p><ul><li><a title="ACCELQ" href="/comparison/accelq">ACCELQ</a></li><li><a title="testRigor" href="/comparison/testrigor">testRigor</a></li><li><a title="BrowserStack" href="/comparison/browserstack">BrowserStack</a></li><li><a title="Sauce Labs" href="/comparison/saucelabs">Sauce Labs</a></li><li><a title="Katalon" href="/comparison/katalon">Katalon</a></li><li><a title="Lambda Test" href="/comparison/lambdatest">Lambda Test</a></li><li><a title="SeeTest" href="/comparison/seetest">SeeTest</a></li><li><a title="Kobiton" href="/comparison/kobiton">Kobiton</a></li><li><a title="Tosca" href="/comparison/tosca">Tosca</a></li><li><a title="Test Project" href="/comparison/testproject">Test Project</a></li><li><a title="Mabl" href="/comparison/mabl">Mabl</a></li><li><a title="All" href="/comparison/all">All</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 lg:col-span-3"><div class="d